EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}It's a complete defeat, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
I really didn't expect you to be such
a good seeker{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}To celebrate your victory,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} I'll send
you something in the mail later!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Tam bir yenilgi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Bu kadar iyi bir arayıcı
olacağını gerçekten beklemiyordum{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Zaferini kutlamak için{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} sana
sonra postayla bir şey göndereceğim!
